# Veilpay browser extension — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (which is git-ignored) and fill in real values.
# Vite exposes only `VITE_`-prefixed variables to the browser bundle. Secrets
# (mnemonics, private keys, PINs) must NEVER go in any VITE_ variable — the
# extension keeps key material in its encrypted IndexedDB vault, not in env.
#
# This extension is Vite-based; the upstream Veilpay app repo
# (github.com/Veilpayapp/VEILPAY-APP) uses EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables for its
# Expo mobile app. The extension runs in the browser, so VITE_* is the
# equivalent prefix here.

# ── Transaction history ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# History is read directly from the testnet chains (Stellar Horizon, Solana
# devnet RPC, EVM Sepolia RPC) using the host permissions in the manifest
# (src/core/chains/{stellar,solana,evm}/history.ts). No backend env var is
# needed. The former VITE_INDEXER_URL backend contract is no longer used.

# ── x402 demo / reference server (dev only) ────────────────────────────────
# The dapp demo page's x402 section expects the reference 402 server on this
# port. Provided by `npm run x402:server` (scripts/x402-reference-server.mjs).
# This is a dev tool, not required for the wallet itself.
# Example: 3402 (the demo page hardcodes http://localhost:3402)

# ── WalletConnect v2 (roadmap 2.12, deferred) ──────────────────────────────
# A real Project ID from https://cloud.walletconnect.com is required for
# WalletConnect sessions to relay. Not read by the current build; unset until
# the WalletConnect integration is implemented and you have a Project ID.
# VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# ── Future / convenience (not read by the current build) ───────────────────
# RPC endpoints are pinned in src/manifest.config.ts as host_permissions
# (testnet only by design), so no VITE_RPC_URL is needed. A per-build override
# for the chain endpoints would belong here when mainnet work starts (Phase 5).
# VITE_EVM_RPC_URL=
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL=
# VITE_STELLAR_RPC_URL=